$comment
Water HF/6-31G(d) frequency calculation. Gaussian applied a 0.95 scale
factor in-line; Q-Chem reports unscaled frequencies — use GoodVibes
`-s 0.95` (or its scaling-factor lookup for HF/6-31G*) at thermo time.
$end

$molecule
0 1
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.117176
H   0.000000   0.757601  -0.468704
